line	<str>Talk to Sir Percival, he will take your magic whistle. Make sure you have another to get to the Fisher Realm yourself.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel back to the Fisher Realm (via Brimhaven or using the fairy ring code BJR. You do not need to fight the Titan again either way)</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Head to the top floor of the castle's eastern tower and take the <col=800000>Holy grail</col>.</col>
step	22	-	Quick guide step 22
line	<str>Talk to King Arthur.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Merlin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Bank all weapons and armour. Travel to Entrana.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the High Priest in the chapel.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Galahad's house west of McGrubor's Wood (fairy ring code ALS) or combat bracelet to Ranging Guild.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Galahad and receive the holy table napkin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Draynor Manor's uk=2 southern-most room with the holy table napkin in your inventory and pick up 2 magic whistles from the table. The whistles will not be visible until you enter the room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare for the fight against the Black Knight Titan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel north-west of Brimhaven to the north-western peninsula (see the minimap image).</str>
line	
line	<str>optional* mine gold ore south west of pillars for Easy Karamja Diary Task</str>
line	
line	<str>Stand under the tower and blow a magic whistle to be teleported to the Fisher Realm.</str>
line	
line	<str>Fight the Black Knight Titan nearby on the bridge and kill the titan with Excalibur. See the in-depth quest guide for details.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head south along the river and talk to the fisherman.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the castle, south-west of the fisherman, pick up the Grail bell from the ground and ring it. (You must stand in front of the bricks to gain access to the castle. Make sure NOT to use the Magic Whistle or you will be teleported outside and you will have to fight the Black Knight Titan again.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the stairs to the south, and talk to the Fisher King. (Make sure to talk to him about both options or you will have to kill the Black Knight Titan again if you leave.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Camelot and talk to King Arthur. Make sure to have 1 empty slot in your inventory for Magic gold feather he gives you.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Goblin Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the Open option on the sacks in the house in the east side of Goblin Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Sir Percival, he will take your magic whistle. Make sure you have another to get to the Fisher Realm yourself.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel back to the Fisher Realm (via Brimhaven or using the fairy ring code BJR. You do not need to fight the Titan again either way)</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the top floor of the castle's eastern tower and take the Holy grail.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Return to <col=800000>King Arthur</col>.</col>
